32474632", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_29271109649141297_7977265845579411909_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=038UfBklJZEQ7kNvwH4fBfY&_nc_oc=AdohWMuUVie2DfFicP_JydSf5pYXDFU-FAT3qNAH9WwUzSAiWIRVP0c-ovWuN08jvD0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUhLx0d8Ayeh7oLVRuxB3DaWq0x9je1XoE30WQCHtlY3w&oe=6B10545E"}, {"file_name": "screenshot5.png", "id": "1088797830417962", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_1088797837084628_2030138725379435615_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qM9fTLnYnyYQ7kNvwH6G6lw&_nc_oc=AdrDyfnQ22IkfNKSbRCVDnF8aJkMZ-luraI3IW2x_4nVIv9VJrxsMJKFHT3wiA-strE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV19nJN5bkyo2Cd1jQKyrcqPMaaHYgzhJX16Dp5Kr2WrA&oe=6B106436"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "YadKon VR", "keywords": ["iran", "memorial", "politics"], "long_description": "YadKon VR is the interactive memorial space designed for standalone Meta Quest headsets. Created as an extension of the YadKon registry, this application provides a tranquil environment for visitors around the world to pay tribute, light candles, and preserve the memory of individuals lost during human rights events in Iran.\n\nKey Features:\n\n- **Interactive Memorial Hall**: Walk through a serene, high-fidelity 3D environment dedicated to reflection and honor.\n- **Flower tributes**: Plant flowers in the memorial space of each individual.\n- **Standalone VR Experience**: Runs natively on Meta Quest 2, 3, 3S, and Pro without needing a tethered PC.\n- **6DOF Positional Motion**: Full room-scale navigation with intuitive Touch Controller interactions.\n\nPurpose & Mission:\n\nYadKon serves as a digital monument and historical archive. It offers a respectful, quiet space for family members, international supporters, and human rights advocates to co